Package: beachrain
Title: Explore How Rain Affects Water Quality at Sydney Swim Sites
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Abhigna", "Tippala", email = "atip0003@student.monash.edu",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides Beachwatch NSW enterococci samples from 77 Sydney swim
    sites (2015 to 2025) matched to rainfall in the previous 72 hours,
    functions that summarise and plot how often samples exceed bacteria
    thresholds after different amounts of rain, and a 'shiny' app that helps
    swimmers judge how much rain changes the water at their beach.
